{"model": "qwen3:14b", "seed": 0, "indices": [49, 53, 5, 33, 65, 62, 51, 38, 61, 45, 27, 64, 17, 36, 67, 12, 32, 58, 34, 70, 73, 72, 57, 9, 19, 6, 46, 4, 43, 21, 30, 35, 54, 22, 69, 20, 39, 40, 13, 48], "error": null, "response": "{\"entities\": [{\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"june-offsite-trondheim\", \"summary\": \"The June offsite happened in Trondheim and produced the current roadmap.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"brown-bag-talk-caching-redesign\", \"summary\": \"Gave the internal brown-bag talk on the caching redesign last Thursday.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"moss-tarrant\", \"summary\": \"Moss Tarrant does the security reviews and has a standing veto on anything that opens a port.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"sunset-v1-api-end-year\", \"summary\": \"Decided to sunset the v1 API at the end of the year rather than maintain both indefinitely.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"update-onboarding-document\", \"summary\": \"Agreed to update the onboarding document after the last two people found it out of date.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"introduction-contact-analytics-vendor\", \"summary\": \"Agreed to make an introduction to the contact at the analytics vendor.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.8, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"cutover-new-cluster-weekend\", \"summary\": \"The cutover to the new cluster happened over a weekend and finished six hours ahead of the window.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"small-pull-requests-over-large\", \"summary\": \"Consistently prefers small pull requests over large ones, and will ask for a split rather than review a big diff.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"review-authentication-consolidation-proposal\", \"summary\": \"Owes a review on the authentication consolidation proposal and has been sitting on it for days.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"comments-explain-why-rather-than-what\", \"summary\": \"Prefers comments that explain why rather than what, and deletes the ones that restate the code.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"buy-feature-flag-system-over-build\", \"summary\": \"Chose to buy the feature-flag system rather than build one, because the build estimate exceeded three years of licence cost.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"revised-infrastructure-numbers-finance-team\", \"summary\": \"Promised the finance team revised infrastructure numbers by the end of the month.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"windlass\", \"summary\": \"Windlass is the effort to consolidate three separate authentication paths into one.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"asynchronous-design-review-over-synchronous-forum\", \"summary\": \"Chose asynchronous design review over a synchronous forum, after attendance at the forum collapsed.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"fortnightly-mentoring-session-newest-team-member\", \"summary\": \"Committed to a fortnightly mentoring session with the newest team member.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.8, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"thabo-mbeki-lawson\", \"summary\": \"Thabo Mbeki-Lawson looks after the observability stack and built the current alerting rules.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"move-off-incumbent-email-provider\", \"summary\": \"Chose to move off the incumbent email provider following the third deliverability incident in a quarter.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"annual-certification-renewal\", \"summary\": \"The annual certification renewal was completed two weeks before the deadline.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.8, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"postgres-over-document-store\", \"summary\": \"Chose Postgres over the document store for the new service, because the access patterns turned out to be relational after all.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"log-retention-ninety-days\", \"summary\": \"Log retention across the estate is ninety days, which is shorter than most people assume.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"traffic-peaks-monday-mornings\", \"summary\": \"Traffic peaks on Monday mornings at roughly triple the weekend baseline.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"production-database-two-versions-behind\", \"summary\": \"The production database is two major versions behind the current release.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"hiring-panel-senior-backend-role\", \"summary\": \"The hiring panel for the senior backend role meets next Tuesday.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"blythe-everard\", \"summary\": \"Blythe Everard chairs the architecture forum and insists every proposal names what it rules out.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"brightwater\", \"summary\": \"Brightwater is the data quality initiative and has produced more dashboards than fixes so far.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"ondine-delacroix\", \"summary\": \"Ondine Delacroix wrote most of the original scheduler and left detailed comments nobody has needed to change.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"one-tool-over-three-tools\", \"summary\": \"Has a standing preference for one tool that does a job adequately over three that each do part of it well.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"ilse-castellan\", \"summary\": \"Ilse Castellan is on secondment from the Lisbon office until the end of the year.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"explicit-error-handling-over-exceptions\", \"summary\": \"Prefers explicit error handling over exceptions propagating silently up the stack.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"marlinspike\", \"summary\": \"Marlinspike is the disaster recovery rehearsal programme, run twice a year.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"weekly-release-train-over-continuous-deployment\", \"summary\": \"Chose a weekly release train over continuous deployment, because the manual verification step could not be removed yet.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"keep-new-billing-logic-existing-service\", \"summary\": \"Decided to keep the new billing logic inside the existing service rather than extract it, since the team is three people.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.8, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"vendor-demo-replacement-observability-tool\", \"summary\": \"The vendor demo for the replacement observability tool is booked for the twelfth.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.8, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"goldcrest\", \"summary\": \"Goldcrest is the pricing engine replacement and is the largest thing currently in flight.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"ninety-days-notice-old-endpoint\", \"summary\": \"Agreed to give downstream consumers ninety days notice before removing the old endpoint.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.85, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"thornfield\", \"summary\": \"Thornfield is the effort to reduce build times, which have crept past twenty minutes.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"boring-well-understood-technology\", \"summary\": \"Has a standing preference for boring, well-understood technology on anything that has to run unattended.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"written-proposal-before-meeting\", \"summary\": \"Prefers a written proposal before any meeting; treats a meeting without a document as a bad sign.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.9, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"ximena-ferreira\", \"summary\": \"Ximena Ferreira is the escalation contact for anything involving the payments provider.\", \"type_confidence\": 0.95, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"march-outage-four-hours\", \"summary\": \"The March outage lasted four hours and was traced to a certificate