ob adequately over three that each do part of it well.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"decided_keep_new_billing_logic_inside_existing_service\", \"summary\": \"Decided to keep the new billing logic inside the existing service rather than extract it, since the team is three people.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"goldcrest_pricing_engine_replacement\", \"summary\": \"Goldcrest is the pricing engine replacement and is the largest thing currently in flight.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"postmortem_payment_double_charge_scheduled_friday_afternoon\", \"summary\": \"The postmortem for the payment double-charge is scheduled for Friday afternoon.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"ondine_delacroix\", \"summary\": \"Ondine Delacroix wrote most of the original scheduler and left detailed comments nobody has needed to change.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"stonecrop_compliance_evidence_gathering_workstream\", \"summary\": \"Stonecrop is the compliance evidence-gathering workstream and has a hard external deadline.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"full_test_suite_takes_forty_minutes_integration_tier\", \"summary\": \"The full test suite takes forty minutes, most of it in the integration tier.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"adaeze_okonjo\", \"summary\": \"Adaeze Okonjo joined in March from a hardware background and still thinks in terms of fixed memory budgets.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"gave_internal_brown_bag_talk_caching_redesign_last_thursday\", \"summary\": \"Gave the internal brown-bag talk on the caching redesign last Thursday.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"avoids_mocks_in_tests_prefers_real_dependencies\", \"summary\": \"Generally avoids mocks in tests, preferring real dependencies wherever they can be made fast enough.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"log_retention_ninety_days_shorter_than_most_assume\", \"summary\": \"Log retention across the estate is ninety days, which is shorter than most people assume.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Commitment\", \"natural_key\": \"promised_send_caching_redesign_write_up_before_end_week\", \"summary\": \"Promised to send the caching redesign write-up before the end of the week.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Event\", \"natural_key\": \"platform_team_split_two_sub_teams_start_quarter\", \"summary\": \"The platform team was split into two sub-teams at the start of the quarter.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"windlass_authentication_paths_consolidation\", \"summary\": \"Windlass is the effort to consolidate three separate authentication paths into one.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"thabo_mbeki-lawson\", \"summary\": \"Thabo Mbeki-Lawson looks after the observability stack and built the current alerting rules.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"rafe_quillon\", \"summary\": \"Rafe Quillon maintains the internal component library and is protective of its API surface.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"static_analysis_licence_expires_end_calendar_year\", \"summary\": \"The static analysis licence expires at the end of the calendar year.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"kestrel_mobile_client_rewrite\", \"summary\": \"Kestrel is the mobile client rewrite; it is on hold until the API versioning question is settled.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Preference\", \"natural_key\": \"prefers_written_proposal_before_meeting\", \"summary\": \"Prefers a written proposal before any meeting; treats a meeting without a document as a bad sign.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"agreed_update_onboarding_document_after_last_two_people_found_outdated\", \"summary\": \"Agreed to update the onboarding document after the last two people found it out of date.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"saltmarsh_internal_developer_portal\", \"summary\": \"Saltmarsh is the internal developer portal, which nobody owns clearly since the last reorganisation.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Person\", \"natural_key\": \"moss_tarrant\", \"summary\": \"Moss Tarrant does the security reviews and has a standing veto on anything that opens a port.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Fact\", \"natural_key\": \"object_storage_growing_four_percent_month_no_pruning\", \"summary\": \"Object storage is growing at about four percent a month with no pruning in place.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Project\", \"natural_key\": \"marlinspike_disaster_recovery_rehearsal_programme\", \"summary\": \"Marlinspike is the disaster recovery rehearsal programme, run twice a year.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"chose_managed_queue_over_running_own_broker\", \"summary\": \"Chose the managed queue over running our own broker, because nobody wanted to be on call for it.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}, {\"entity_type\": \"Decision\", \"natural_key\": \"chose_move_off_incumbent_email_provider_third_deliverability_incident\", \"summary\": \"Chose to move off the incumbent email provider following the third deliverability incident in a quarter.\", \"type_confidence\": 1, \"considered_types\": []}]}", "wall_s": 37.84459352493286, "prompt_eval_count": 1287, "prompt_eval_duration": 500656000, "eval_count": 2383, "eval_duration": 37157088000, "done_reason": "stop"}
