{"model": "qwen3:8b", "seed": 6, "indices": [73, 10, 62, 33, 4, 0, 18, 60, 47, 40, 2, 34, 77, 25, 52, 12, 24, 36, 35, 44, 51, 46, 16, 42, 59, 39, 43, 5, 27, 21, 65, 23, 26, 57, 28, 72, 6, 64, 70, 79], "error": null, "response": "{\"entities\": [{\"entity_type\":\"Fact\",\"natural_key\":\"traffic_peaks_monday_mornings\",\"summary\":\"Traffic peaks on Monday mornings at roughly triple the weekend baseline.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Person\",\"natural_key\":\"rafe_quillon\",\"summary\":\"Rafe Quillon maintains the internal component library and is protective of its API surface.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"sunset_v1_api_end_year\",\"summary\":\"Decided to sunset the v1 API at the end of the year rather than maintain both indefinitely.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Person\",\"natural_key\":\"ilse_castellan\",\"summary\":\"Ilse Castellan is on secondment from the Lisbon office until the end of the year.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Person\",\"natural_key\":\"corbin_vidrine\",\"summary\":\"Corbin Vidrine runs the data platform team and is the person to ask about anything touching the ingest pipeline.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Project\",\"natural_key\":\"kestrel\",\"summary\":\"Kestrel is the mobile client rewrite; it is on hold until the API versioning question is settled.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Commitment\",\"natural_key\":\"send_caching_redesign_write_up_end_week\",\"summary\":\"Promised to send the caching redesign write-up before the end of the week.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural_key\":\"prefer_sql_over_orm\",\"summary\":\"Prefers writing SQL directly over using an ORM for anything analytical.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural,\":\"prefer_written_proposal_before_meeting\",\"summary\":\"Prefers a written proposal before any meeting; treats a meeting without a document as a bad sign.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Person\",\"natural_key\":\"fenn_halloran\",\"summary\":\"Fenn Halloran is the only person who understands the old billing reconciliation job end to end.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"choose_postgres_over_document_store\",\"summary\":\"Chose Postgres over the document store for the new service, because the access patterns turned out to be relational after all.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Fact\",\"natural_key\":\"full_test_suite_takes_forty_minutes\",\"summary\":\"The full test suite takes forty minutes, most of it in the integration tier.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"keep_monorepo_instead_split\",\"summary\":\"Decided to keep the monorepo rather than split it, on the grounds that cross-cutting changes were the common case.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Event\",\"natural_key\":\"postmortem_payment_double_charge_friday_afternoon\",\"summary\":\"The postmortem for the payment double-charge is scheduled for Friday afternoon.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Person\",\"natural_key\":\"thabo_mbeki-lawson\",\"summary\":\"Thabo Mbeki-Lawson looks after the observability stack and built the current alerting rules.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"choose_managed_queue_over_own_broker\",\"summary\":\"Chose the managed queue over running our own broker, because nobody wanted to be on call for it.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"choose_asynchronous_design_review_over_synchronous_forum\",\"summary\":\"Chose asynchronous design review over a synchronous forum, after attendance at the forum collapsed.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"keep_new_billing_logic_inside_existing_service\",\"summary\":\"Decided to keep the new billing logic inside the existing service rather than extract it, since the team is three people.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural_key\":\"reserve_mornings_for_deep_work\",\"summary\":\"Reserves mornings for deep work as a standing rule and schedules meetings after two.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Event\",\"natural_key\":\"cutover_new_cluster_weekend\",\"summary\":\"The cutover to the new cluster happened over a weekend and finished six hours ahead of the window.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural_key\":\"prefer_one_tool_over_three\",\"summary\":\"Has a standing preference for one tool that does a job adequately over three that each do part of it well.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Project\",\"natural_key\":\"stonecrop\",\"summary\":\"Stonecrop is the compliance evidence-gathering workstream and has a hard external deadline.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural_key\":\"prefer_flat_directory_structure\",\"summary\":\"Prefers flat directory structures and resists nesting beyond about three levels.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Event\",\"natural_key\":\"quarterly_roadmap_review_last_week_month\",\"summary\":\"The quarterly roadmap review is scheduled for the last week of the month.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural_key\":\"prefer_boring_well_understood_technology\",\"summary\":\"Has a standing preference for boring, well-understood technology on anything that has to run unattended.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Preference\",\"natural_key\":\"prefer_explicit_error_handling\",\"summary\":\"Prefers explicit error handling over exceptions propagating silently up the stack.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Person\",\"natural_key\":\"moss_tarrant\",\"summary\":\"Moss Tarrant does the security reviews and has a standing veto on anything that opens a port.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"buy_feature_flag_system_over_build\",\"summary\":\"Chose to buy the feature-flag system rather than build one, because the build estimate exceeded three years of licence cost.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Project\",\"natural_key\":\"marlinspike\",\"summary\":\"Marlinspike is the disaster recovery rehearsal programme, run twice a year.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Commitment\",\"natural_key\":\"update_onboarding_document_after_two_people_found_outdated\",\"summary\":\"Agreed to update the onboarding document after the last two people found it out of date.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Project\",\"natural_key\":\"saltmarsh\",\"summary\":\"Saltmarsh is the internal developer portal, which nobody owns clearly since the last reorganisation.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Decision\",\"natural_key\":\"drop_support_oldest_browser_tier\",\"summary\":\"Decided to drop support for the oldest browser tier after traffic fell below half a percent.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\":[]},{\"entity_type\":\"Event\",\"natural_key\":\"hiring_panel_senior_backend_role_meets_next_tuesday\",\"summary\":\"The hiring panel for the senior backend role meets next Tuesday.\",\"type_confidence\":1,\"considered_types\